<title>CHINA: Shanghai port containers thruput up 29 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Shanghai port containers thruput up 29 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai port handled 1.97 million containers in 1996, up 440,000 or 29 percent from 1995, the Liberation Daily said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said Shanghai port handled a total of 163.8 million tonnes of all forms of cargo in 1996. This was marginally down on the 1995 total of 165.67 million tonnes.</p>
